<title>USA: PicTuretel names Richard Goldman CFO.</title>
<headline>PicTuretel names Richard Goldman CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ANDOVER, Mass. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>PictureTel Corp said Thursday it appointed Richard Goldman vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Goldman succeeds Les Strauss, who recently retired.</p>
<p>Goldman was most recently senior vice president and CFO of Giga Information Group in Cambridge, Mass, PictureTel said.</p>
